   385|                <p><strong>Evidence:</strong> Research published in journals like <em>Journal of Clinical Oncology</em> and <em>Cancer</em> has shown that specific TCM herbal formulas can help manage treatment side effects. Always consult your oncologist before starting TCM during cancer treatment.</p>
