                <div class="timeline-item">
                    <h4>1991</h4>
                    <p>WHO established the Traditional Medicine Programme, providing strategic directions for integrating traditional medicine into health systems.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="timeline-item">
                    <h4>2002</h4>
                    <p>WHO launched the WHO Traditional Medicine Strategy 2002-2005, first comprehensive global strategy document for traditional medicine.</p>
